        "TileImage": "$($repository ab7da4b9-fb66-4d25-acfe-9a8d58c4ffbc).Image",
        "Description": "Hello 47!\r\rYour next targets are three employees of the private Gama hospital in Hokkaido. The group have been using their status at the hospital to gather information on the patients and blackmail them for their fortune. They work together, they are precise, and they are ruthless. They managed to evade both the hospital&apos;s security and the police so far, but I doubt they will be able to evade you.\r\rGood luck 47!",
